U.S. SEC / Investor Advisory Committee (IAC) recommendations re: retail access to private markets

The SEC’s IAC has made recommendations to improve retail investor access to private markets, via registered vehicles with protections (mutual funds, interval funds), better disclosure, strengthened valuation, clearer conflicts-of-interest rules. 
